I *often* eat while satiated. As long as you have done something 
different than eating for, say, 20 turns, you'll get the confirmation 
message to "continue eating". I have often been able to eat a giant 
corpse that way, when I was satiated to start with.

Just eat the corpse, and answer "no" to continue eating. Then, wait or 
search for twenty turns (ie until the turn counter is twenty higher, not 
twenty "."-presses). Then, start eating again. Rinse and repeat.

This will more often than not result in you being able to eat the entire 
corpse, thus gaining the posssible benefits. Sometimes, when you started 
out too satiated, the corpse may disappear before you finish it. It 
never causes sickness, though.

